# VS Code REST Client (humao.rest-client) requests. Start the server first: npm run dev
@host = localhost:3000

### Echo a request
DELETE http://{{host}}/anything?foo=bar
x-trace: 1

### Echo with delay (smallest of path/header/query wins) and custom status
POST http://{{host}}/anything/2000?delay=1500
Content-Type: application/json
delay: 1000
status: 503

{ "hello": "world" }

### Build a fake token
# @name buildFakeToken
POST http://{{host}}/oauth/_build_fake
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "iss": "http://{{host}}",
  "sub": "alice",
  "aud": "my-api",
  "client_id": "my-app",
  "exp": {{$timestamp 1 h}},
  "iat": {{$timestamp}},
  "jti": "{{$guid}}",
  "scope": "openid profile",
  "additional_fake_props": {
    "clientId": "my-app",
    "clientSecret": "s3cret",
    "active": true,
    "omit": ["jti"]
  }
}

### Introspect it (Basic my-app:s3cret) -> active: true
POST http://{{host}}/oauth/introspect
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Authorization: Basic bXktYXBwOnMzY3JldA==

token={{buildFakeToken.response.body.*}}

### Wrong credentials -> 401
POST http://{{host}}/oauth/introspect
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Authorization: Basic bXktYXBwOndyb25n

token={{buildFakeToken.response.body.*}}

### Decode any JWT payload
GET http://{{host}}/oauth/_decode_token
Authorization: Bearer {{buildFakeToken.response.body.*}}

### Colored page
GET http://{{host}}/green

### Health
GET http://{{host}}/health
